g does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-17\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's investment in AI labs does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-18\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's revenue figures do not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-19\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's quarterly revenue does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-20\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"An earnings forecast does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-21\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's quarterly revenue and earnings do not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-22\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Overall demand exceeding supply does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-23\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The profit margin comparison does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-24\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Revenue guidance does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-25\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Hyperscaler spending forecasts do not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-26\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Unconstrained demand does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-27\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Days sales outstanding does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-28\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's net income does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-29\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Quarterly revenue guidance does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-30\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nscale's loss and revenue do not address Nvidia exports to China.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-31\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Production of Vera Rubin does not indicate whether Blackwell exports will be authorized.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-32\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"DeepSeek's Huawei chip cluster does not indicate a U.S. authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-33\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"AI agent compute needs do not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-34\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's data center revenue does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-35\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's overall supply shortfall does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-36\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The research center installation does not concern exports to China.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-37\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The supply-constrained outlook does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-38\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Third-party infrastructure capital does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-39\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The supplier qualification program does not address chip exports to China.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-40\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Quarterly revenue does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-41\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"A share-price calculation does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-42\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The autonomous freight collaboration does not address Blackwell exports to China.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-43\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"AI infrastructure investment does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-44\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"AMD data center revenue growth does not address Nvidia export authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-45\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"GPU rental prices do not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-46\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nvidia's guarantee obligations do not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-47\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Hyperscaler capital spending does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-48\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Alibaba's chip launch does not state a U.S. decision or plan on Blackwell exports.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-49\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The implied revenue growth rate does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-50\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Hyperscaler spending does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-51\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Share-price forecasts do not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-52\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"A share-price target does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-53\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nscale's contracted value does not address Nvidia exports to China.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-54\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nscale's operating regions and power capacity do not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-55\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The research center installation does not concern exports to China.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-56\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Huawei's chip shipping plan does not state a U.S. decision or plan on Blackwell exports.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-57\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Huawei chip performance does not indicate whether the U.S. will authorize Blackwell exports.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-58\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Nscale's customer concentration does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-59\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Gross margin guidance does not address the authorization.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v6-1-60\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"Revenue guidance does not indicate an export authorization decision.\"}\n{\"done\":true,\"items\":60}"}}
